# Protected paths for the risky list: changes here wait for the owner's merge.
# Replace @owner with the owner's handle. On GitLab Free this file documents
# ownership; approval enforcement needs a paid tier or a protected-branch rule.
# Without either, nothing blocks the merge: the agent reads this list before
# setting auto-merge and leaves a matching MR for the owner.
# A refactor that moves code out of a path below adds its new file here in
# the same MR; otherwise the moved code quietly starts auto-merging.

# the human gate
/src/lib/human.py                 @owner

# the write path
/src/api/writer.py                @owner
/src/execute.py                   @owner

# owner files and threshold values
/ssot/user-stories.tsv            @owner
/ssot/policies.tsv                @owner
/ssot/glossary.tsv                @owner
/ssot/constants.tsv               @owner
/console/ui_rules.tsv             @owner

# human-data table schema and protections
/src/lib/db_human.py              @owner

# the agent instructions themselves
/CLAUDE.md                        @owner
